Date: Fri, 1 May 2026 10:46:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 08/23] feat(vr): render loaded OpenVSP models in VR phase 2

Wire the VR runtime to load .vsp3 files and draw sampled OpenVSP geometry in stereo with room-scale placement, fallback bounds handling, and symmetry-aware surf sampling so mirrored components appear in-headset.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>

